---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Catch-up API
    participant B as Worker / closing API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    Note over R,D: Row selector: customer_billing_state.customer_id = C<br/>Event row: usage_inbox.source = S and usage_inbox.event_id = E<br/>Request advisory identity: api_idempotency_operations.operation_scope<br/>plus api_idempotency_operations.idempotency_key (not a row lock)
    Note over R,D: October is closed, November and December are missing.<br/>Both missing months have ended.
    alt Catch-up gets the account first
        R->>D: BEGIN, catch-up request lock<br/>FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        B->>D: BEGIN, FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        Note over B,D: WAIT through the complete recovery range
        loop November then December, in one transaction
            R->>D: Build from processed groups and active add-ons<br/>Freeze month, snapshot and group links<br/>Advance invoice number and state_version
        end
        R->>D: Store whole range in api_idempotency_operations<br/>COMMIT all months and the request result together
        D-->>B: Account lock granted
        alt Waiting operation is a worker for November usage
            B->>D: Read closure history and rate into an open month<br/>At or after January and durable usage_inbox row month, COMMIT
        else Waiting operation closes December
            B->>D: Read original December snapshot, COMMIT
        end
    else Other operation gets the account first
        B->>D: BEGIN, FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        R->>D: BEGIN, catch-up request lock<br/>FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        Note over R,D: WAIT for the worker or single-month close
        alt Worker processes November usage
            B->>D: Account into November while open, COMMIT
            D-->>R: Account lock granted
            R->>D: Read processed groups, include usage in recovery
        else Single close attempts December before November
            B->>D: ROLLBACK with 409 for the missing predecessor
            D-->>R: Account lock granted
            R->>D: Recover November and December
        end
        R->>D: Store whole range and COMMIT
    end
    Note over R,D: Same-key replay returns the stored full range.<br/>Different keys serialize on the account and cannot duplicate invoices.<br/>Any failed month rolls back the entire range and its request result.
